      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that's more like it. i'll use that formula for the report. one more thing—if we realize the loss happened over several months rather than just this one period, is there a specific way we should handle the adjustment so the expenses don't look weirdly huge in just one month? i want to make sure the financial statements stay smooth.",
